# Files listed here are preserved when tenant workspaces are regenerated
# from tenant-template/ (scripts/regenerate_tenant_workspaces.py).
# One filename per line.
#
# index.html was pinned here while this tenant ran a hand-edited portal with a
# studio-space carousel and a custom SEO title. Both are template features now
# (website_profile.about_* and website_profile.seo_*), and the forked content
# was moved into this tenant's brand settings by
# backend/scripts/reclaim_letspaint_portal.py — so the workspace tracks
# tenant-template/ again and template fixes reach it.
#
# Do not re-pin a generated file. If a tenant needs something the template
# cannot express, add the capability to the template as a brand field.
